* =====================================================================
* FGFET equivalent subcircuit for LTspice - Fig. 1(c) of Kim et al., IEEE Access 2023
* LTspice port of models/fgfet_subckt.sp (ngspice + OSDI).
*
* LTspice has no Verilog-A / OSDI, so the Verilog-A coupling capacitor C_VA
* (models/cva_cap.va) is written as a charge-defined capacitor (C ... Q={...}).
* The charge is the same closed form the .va file integrates:
*     C(v) = Cmin + (Cmax-Cmin)/2 * (1 + tanh((v-Vfb)/Vslp))
*     q(v) = W * ( (Cmax+Cmin)/2 * v + (Cmax-Cmin)/2 * Vslp * ln(cosh((v-Vfb)/Vslp)) )
* with ln(cosh(x)) = |x| + ln(1+exp(-2|x|)) - ln 2, and v = V(WL) - V(MN) (= x in LTspice).
* The BSIM4 cards are the unchanged ngspice-fitted cards (LTspice's BSIM4 reproduces
* them to ~5 digits).
*
* Terminals: WL DL SL SS B     (word line, data line, sense line, SFET source, bulk)
* Parameters: w_dev (width of VFET = SFET = C_VA), delvto_val (SFET Vth shift)
*
* The netlist that includes this file must set  .options gmin=1e-15 chgtol=1e-18
* (see fgfet_32nm_compact_model/README.md, "Simulator settings").
* =====================================================================
.include sfet_32nm.pm
.include vfet_32nm.pm

.param cva_Cmax=8.50298e-17 cva_Cmin=1.81375e-15 cva_Vfb=0.339355 cva_Vslp=0.0787248

.subckt FGFET WL DL SL SS B params: w_dev=64n delvto_val=0
* 1. vertical access FET: drain = DL, gate = WL, source = memory node MN
M_VFET DL WL MN B vfet_nmos L=100.2n W={w_dev}
* 2. sense FET: drain = SL, gate = MN, source = SS
M_SFET SL MN SS B sfet_nmos L=32n W={w_dev} delvto={delvto_val}
* 3. WL-MN coupling capacitor C_VA (charge form of cva_cap.va); x = V(WL)-V(MN)
C_CVA WL MN Q={(w_dev/1u)*(0.5*(cva_Cmax+cva_Cmin)*x+0.5*(cva_Cmax-cva_Cmin)*cva_Vslp*(abs((x-cva_Vfb)/cva_Vslp)+ln(1+exp(-2*abs((x-cva_Vfb)/cva_Vslp)))-ln(2)))}
* 4. 1000 TOhm DC path so the floating node has a defined operating point
R_conv MN 0 1000T
.ends FGFET
